Knowledge used, no code copied: the decode mode of the Android Auto cluster map
(native/src/sal/decode.c) follows what the project mst2-altscreen-carplay (GPL-3.0-or-later)
measured in a car on the sister firmware P0480T: a second mm-renderer context beside the
stock one, "overlay=0", a window one pixel narrower than the cluster source display, and that
a window DisplayManager still has on its list must not be destroyed. Its documentation is
cited in the source; its code is not part of this work.

No vendor firmware, binaries or map data are part of this repository. The HMI bundle is
compiled against the HMI of the user's own unit, which the user converts from the
unit's MIBHMI.jxe and which is not distributed here.

